The '''Palace of Zhol'''<!--Palace of the Soviets--> is an [[wikipedia:official residence|official residence]] of the [[House of Zhifol]] and seat of the [[Government of Qym]]. It is located in the neighborhood of [[TBD]], in central [[Zhol]]. The Palace of Zhol is designed as a staggered stack of ribbed cylinders crowned with a 100-meter (330 ft) statue of [[Bacha XII of Qym|King Bacha XII]], representing [[Qym]]ish modernism. At the time of its completion in {{abbr|2345|1948 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, it was the tallest building on [[Basis]], and remained so until it was surpassed by the [[TALLER BUILDING]] in {{abbr|2372|1970.48 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. As of {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, it is the [[List of tallest buildings in Qym|tallest building in Qym]] and the 16th [[List of tallest buildings on Basis|tallest on Basis]]. 

